<section class="content-section bg-primary text-white" id="donations">
  <div class="container px-4 px-lg-5">
    <div class="content-section-heading text-center">
      <h2 class="mx-auto mb-5">How To Donate</h2>
      <p>Bring your donations to our next event or reach out to us by email <a href="mailto:info@communityexchange.art" target="_blank">info@communityexchange.art</a> to set up a different time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section-heading text-center">
      <h2 class="mx-auto mb-5">What To Donate</h2>
      <p>We accept new or gently-used art and craft supplies in these categories:</p>
    </div>
      <ul>
        <li>fabric</li>
        <li>notions (needles, thread, pins, buttons, zippers, bias tape, ribbon)</li>
        <li>yarn</li>
        <li>needles (knitting, crochet, latch hook)</li>
        <li>canvases</li>
        <li>paints (oil, acrylic, poster, fingerpainting)</li>
        <li>paintbrushes</li>
        <li>paper</li>
        <li>sketchbooks</li>
        <li>pencils, charcoal, pastels</li>
        <li>markers, crayons, coloring books</li>
        <li>cutting tools</li>
        <li>all types of glue</li>
        <li>stickers</li>
        <li>small toys</li>
        <li>journaling/scrapbook paper</li>
        <li>jewelry-making materials</li>
        <li>craft kits</li>
        <li>instructional and pattern books</li>
        <li>school and office supplies</li>
      </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section bg-light" id="faqs">
  <div class="container px-4 px-lg-5">
    <div class="content-section-heading">
      <h2 class="mx-auto mb-5 text-center">FAQs</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>What happens at Let's Get Crafty?</li>
        <p>It's a new, free meetup where you can chat with other creatives while working on a craft you bring or join a beginner session. </p>
        <li>How much do art supplies cost at the exchange?</li>
        <p>It&apos;s all FREE! Come pick out anything you need.</p>
        <li>Where can I donate supplies before the exchange?</li>
        <p>To make arrangements, email <a href="mailto:info@communityexchange.art" target="_blank">info@communityexchange.art</a></p>
        <li>Do you accept canvases that are already painted on?</li>
        <p>Absolutely! Whomever takes it home will modify it to their creative use.</p>
        <li>What happens to all the donations that remain at the end of the exchange?</li>
        <p>We have storage space to store the supplies between events.</p>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
